func=jag::PlayerList::HandleAbsolutePlayerPositions	func_addr=0x00bd1a00	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=WALK-ANIM ROOT CAUSE: local player slot+0x28 (MoveSpeed) is hardcoded to &enumArray[0]\eSTATIONARY here (puVar9[5]\e&DAT_015bf210). Low-res players get enumArray[(v>>18)&3]. Since single-tile GPI walks (moveType 1 flag\e0) never change slot+0x28, a GPI-driven local player stays at STATIONARY MoveSpeed -> SelectBaseAnimation plays the STAND anim while the position lerps \e glide with no legs. Live likely client-predicts the local player instead of GPI-driving it.
