func=jag::HitmarksAndHeadbars::RemoveHeadbar	func_addr=0x004c8600	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::HitmarksAndHeadbars::RemoveHeadbar(HitmarksAndHeadbars* ring, int typeId)\n\nScans the 0x1b0-stride slot vector (ring+0x28..ring+0x30) for the slot whose\nfirst node's def (node+0x18) has id (def+0x8) \e\e typeId, then erases that ENTIRE\nslot via FUN_00490830 -- i.e. it drops every queued state for that headbar type,\nnot just the current one. Silently returns if no slot matches.\n\nIdentified by cross-version sig-scan from the verified 948-5 build\n(FUN_00626a40  -> tail call 0x00624df0); pattern\n"49 83 7A 40 00 74 ?? 4D 8B 1A 49 8B 43 18 3B 70 08" matched uniquely here.\nReached from the ext-info headbar sublist when the wire selector \e\e 0x7fff.
