func=jag::game::HeightMap::SampleTileLinkHeightOffset	func_addr=0x0048e740	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=HeightMap secondary height source: per-vertex location/tile-link height OFFSET added on top of the base bilinear terrain sample by SampleRegionFineHeight when addTileLinkOffset(mode)!\e0. Grid lives inside the per-mapsquare region height container: count at container+0x1d0 (planes), int16 grid ptr at container+0x1d8. Cell \e ptr + plane*0x4000 + col*0x100 + row*4 ; each cell \e 2x int16 {s0@+0, s1@+2}. col\evertexCol\efineX>>9, row\evertexRow\efineY>>9 (mapsquare-local tile 0..63), both clamped [0,63]. mode 1 \e> return (int16)s0 ; mode 2 \e> return max(s0,s1) [under/over-bridge]; else 0. NOT interpolated (floor vertex). plane<0 or plane>\ecount \e> 0. Behavior-derived name.
