func=jag::PacketHandlers::MapProjanim	func_addr=0x000f3aa0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=MAP_PROJANIM (S2C, top-op 132, zone sub-op idx 4, size 20). Tile->tile projectile via jag::ProjectileList::Add. Target is a TILE (source + signed dx/dy), NOT an entity index; lockon uses static defaults &DAT_01446f18. 949 wire (raw/BE); DISASM-verified consumes bytes 0..16, then advances pos to +20 (bytes 17,18,19 RESERVED/unread -> server writes 3 pad bytes):\n+0  g1  srcCoord \e (localX&7)<<3 | (localY&7) | flag<<7   [X bits3-5 +baseTileX, Y bits0-2 +baseTileY, bit7\eflag arg7]\n+1  g1s targetDeltaY (signed, tiles from src)\n+2  g1s targetDeltaX (signed)\n+3  g3(BE) medium (ProjectileList::Add arg6; role uncertain -- confirm)\n+6  g2(BE) spotanimId/graphicId (0xffff \e no projectile, gate)\n+8  g1s startHeight (<<4 fine)\n+9  g1s endHeight (<<4 fine)\n+10 g2(BE) startTime/delay [inferred]\n+12 g2(BE) endTime/lifetime [inferred]\n+14 g1  alpha (0xff \e default opaque; ProjectileList::Add param_17)\n+15 g2(BE) angle/lockonSlot (<<2) [inferred]\n+17..19 RESERVED (3 bytes, unread)
