func=jag::game::Entity::~Entity	func_addr=0x004f4490	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=1719	cu_index_from_entry=364	text=PathingEntity::NAME is an eastl::fixed_string<char,64> BASED AT this+0x90, spanning 0x90..0xf7:\n  0x90 mpBegin | 0x98 mnSize | 0xa0 mnCapacity|heapMask (0x800000000000003F)\n  0xa7 SSO/heap marker | 0xa8 allocator slot (NEVER written by the ctor)\n  0xb0 mpPoolBegin -> 0xb8 | 0xb8..0xf7 inline 64-byte buffer\nNext members confirm the span: eastl::string at 0xf8 (marker 0x10f) and at 0x110 (marker 0x127).\n\e> engine offsets LAST_MOVESPEED\e0x98, NEXT_X_OFFSET_FINE\e0xa0, NEXT_Y_OFFSET_FINE\e0xa8 are ALL\ninside this string header and are invalid.
