func=jag::MainLogicManager::MouseInputRecorder::OnButton0Down	func_addr=0x00cbcd30	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::MainLogicManager::MouseInputRecorder::OnButton0Down -- CLICK ring producer for button id 0\n(the left button). Registered as the first of the recorder's eight input delegates.\n\nPushes one MouseSample into clickRing with button \e 0, raw + scaled coordinates and an\nevent-time timestamp, then sets recorder->button0Down. Same drop-oldest overflow rule as the\nmovement ring. The matching OnButton0Up delegate only clears the held flag: RELEASES ARE NEVER\nPUSHED, so the click prot carries presses only.\n\nThe two sibling functions OnButton1Down / OnButton2Down are byte-for-byte the same shape with\nbutton \e 1 / 2 and the corresponding held flag.
