func=jag::LoginManager::LoginStepHandleLoginData	func_addr=0x001db7a0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=949 login-response decoder. CAPTURE-VERIFIED: the live members lobby capture (SUCCESS 02 + u8 len 0x67 + 103B) is decoded by the loginType!\e2 (LOBBY) branch and consumes exactly 103 bytes. Lobby branch writes self playerIndex as g2 at wire off 32-33 -> LoggedInPlayer+0x1C and carries the world-redirect (worldId g2, host gJagString "world4.runescape.com", port1 g2\e43594, port2 g2\e443, sessionId1 g8, sessionId2 g8). World branch (loginType\e\e2) is a shorter distinct layout (self index g2 at wire off 7-8 -> +0x48; never reads staffModLevel +0x88). Full 103B field table in docs/949-1/net/social/login-block.md
