func=jag::PlayerList::GetLowResolutionPlayerPosition	func_addr=0x001624e0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::PlayerList::GetLowResolutionPlayerPosition(playerList, packet, playerIdx) — decodes one low-res player record in GPI (op22, PLAYER_INFO). Slot \e PlayerInfoSlot (+0 plane&3, +4 mapSquareX/regionX, +8 mapSquareY/regionY, +0x28 MoveSpeed*).\n[2] updateType:\n 0 \e ADD/PROMOTE to high-res: [1] recursePrev (if set, decode this slot's prior low-res move first), [6] localX, [6] localY, [1] queueExtInfo. World tile \e (mapSquareX*64 + localX, mapSquareY*64 + localY). Builds the high-res entity; then lazily reads appearance/spotanim sub-block via Packet::gScrambled* (count gScrambledUbyte, then per-anim shorts/uint). Returns 1 on promote.\n 1 \e FACE/rotate only: [2] rotation -> plane +\e rotation (&3).\n 2 \e SMALL local move: [5] \e dir8[2:0] (8-dir +/-1 on mapSquareX/Y) | planeDelta[4:3].\n 3 \e REGION jump: [20] \e regionY[7:0] | regionX[15:8] | plane[17:16] | moveSpeed[19:18]; each added to the slot fields (&0xff / &3); moveSpeed \e &MoveSpeed::enumArray[bits19:18].\nCORRECTED 2026-06-29: ADD-path 6-bit order is localX THEN localY (first read pairs with mapSquareX/regionX \e X axis; cross-confirmed vs beta GetLowResolutionPlayerPosition  where firstAxis uses regionX). VERIFIED 948-5.
