func=jag::PlayerEntity::ProcessExtendedInfo	func_addr=0x0016c960	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=PLAYER_INFO ext-info decoder (949-1). uVar41 \e LE 1..4-byte updateFlags mask; header expansion ("continue") bits \e {5,14,17} (byte0 bit5 -> byte1; byte1 bit6 -> byte2; byte2 bit1 -> byte3). Per-block scramble cipher cursor \e context(local_138)+0x28, reset per block to its const table (the local_110 \e &DAT_00d66d.. stores). Bit->block (dispatch order): 1 bit13 slot(g2+uint+byte); 2 bit10 CHAT_TEXT(str->AddChat t2); 3 bit12 CHAT_TEXT_PRIVATE/customisation(compound guard, cache slot+0x60/70/78); 4 bit7 FACE_DIRECTION(g2 mode3 ->+0x23c); 5 bit26 SPOT_ANIM_REMOVAL; 6 bit4 HITMARKS(count+gSmart1or2 0x7fff/0x7ffe ->AddHitmark/AddHeadbar); 7 bit9 slot; 8 bit11 OVERHEAD_OPACITY(byte mode0 ->+0x1074); 9 bit2 APPEARANCE(len gScrambledByte mode0 PLAIN + payload gScrambledArrayBuffer mode2 add; QueueExtendedInfoPacket; cache slot+0x40/50/58; cipher table\e{00,02}, CHANGED from 948 {03,02}); 10 bit3 slot; 11 bit1 EXACT_MOVE(4x gSmart2or4s loop + byte); 12 bit23 HEAD_ICON(byte+3xg2); 13 bit24 spot-anim list; 14 bit27 slot; 15 bit18 OVERHEAD_CHAT(str+flags byte ->AddChat); 16 bit19 spot-anim list(GetTypeBySlot); 17 bit6 FORCED_MOVEMENT(6x gScrambledUbyte + 3x g2 -> SetForcedMovement); 18 bit20 POSITION_COLOR(3xUbyte HSL+byte bright+2xg2 -> HSLToRGBLookup ->+0x32/34); 19 bit8 UNK(2byte+g2); 20 bit22 spot-anim list(GetTypeBySlot); 21 bit16 slot; 22 bit0 OVERHEAD_TEXT(gScrambledMedium ->+0x35); 23 bit25 HITMARKS_2 (2nd hits+headbars channel, no 948 analogue); 24 bit21 TRANSIENT_BOOL(byte mode1 ->+0x1071).
