func=jag::Client::DiscardPendingInput	func_addr=0x00347770	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::Client::DiscardPendingInput -- drains the MOUSE recorder's two rings by copying each ring's\nwrite cursor into its read cursor, and blanks the sample records (button set to -1, coordinates\nzeroed, timestamps left alone). It also clears an unrelated hash table.\n\nIt does NOT touch the keyboard recorder's key ring or character ring. Any synthetic key entries\ntherefore survive a discard that would wipe synthetic mouse entries.
