func=jag::PlayerList::GetHighResolutionPlayerPosition	func_addr=0x00163930	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=Q1 (temp-move-type): NO ext-info movement-type flag exists in 948. Walk-vs-run animation is driven ONLY by slot+0x28 (MoveSpeed enumArray idx: 0\eSTATIONARY,1\eCRAWL,2\eWALK,3\eRUN,4\eINSTANT), set ONLY by GPI movement records: moveType-3 seed (here) stores moveSpeed; moveType-1 running WALK sets idx3(RUN) via &DAT_015bf21c; low-res region-jump sets MoveSpeed[delta]. moveType-1 non-running and moveType-2 RUN REUSE the existing slot+0x28 (server must keep it seeded). ProcessExtendedInfo writes no move-type. Temp-move-type flag is fully DEPRECATED.
