func=jag::PlayerList::GetHighResolutionPlayerPosition	func_addr=0x00163930	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=1312	cu_index_from_entry=325	text=moveType 3 TELEPORT, big\e\e0 SMALL/SEED form. 15-bit packed, decoded here. BINARY-VERIFIED bit layout (disasm 0x155250-0x155330, cross-checked vs big-coord + capture-verified GPI-init Burthorpe): dy\ebits[4:0] (signed 5b) -> Y-axis fine +\edy*512+curY (stored struct+0xc); dx\ebits[9:5] (signed 5b) -> X-axis fine +\edx*512+curX (stored struct+4); plane\ebits[11:10]; moveSpeed\ebits[14:12]. i.e. X in the HIGH 5 bits, Y in the LOW 5 bits. Delta is added to LAST-WAYPOINT logical pos (GetCurrentFinePosition returns tile-aligned target, not interp render pos) \e> NO sub-tile drift. moveSpeed idx 0-3 \e smooth waypoint via FUN_0044fbc0; idx 4 \e INSTANT WARP via vtable+0x170 + slot+0x28 reset to STATIONARY. WARNING: docs/net/serverprot/player-info-948-5.md writeHighRes had dx/dy TRANSPOSED (dx at [4:0], dy at [9:5]) -> server dx lands in client Y; a large single-axis seed delta goes perpendicular \e> extreme drift on long walks, ~invisible on 1-tile diagonal clicks. Correct encode: (moveSpeed<<12)|(plane<<10)|((dx&0x1f)<<5)|(dy&0x1f).
