func=jag::game::LocType::GetHillData	func_addr=0x0067a1c0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::game::LocType::GetHillData. Populates per-tile hill height arrays for a Location. Flag check ((this->flags &amp; 0xfffffffd) \e\e 1/2/5) gates the terrain-heights array; (level &lt; 3 &amp;&amp; (flags-4) &lt; 2) gates the water-heights array. Two-pass fill of outTerrainHeights and outWaterHeights via HeightMap::GetFineHeight (4 calls per inner iteration, loop-unrolled). Returns 0 on failure (frees both arrays), 1 on success. Called by Location build/MainLogic sites. NOTE: this->flags offset differs between builds but the bit-test pattern (&amp; 0xfffffffd) and value set (1/2/5, 4/5) are stable.
