func=jag::Js5MasterIndex::Js5MasterIndex	func_addr=0x00b6c7f0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=Js5MasterIndex ctor. Parses blob (packet param_4): pos\e1; gT_u32 (signature-region length); byte@5 \e archiveCount (bVar4); param_1[0]\ecount-1. Entries table \e count*0x50 bytes from offset 6. Trailing RSA signature.\nVERIFICATION (2 gates, BOTH must pass or archive_count/entries stay 0):\n 1) RSA: result \e sig^(*key2) mod (*key1), keys \e param_2/param_3 (\e provider+0x60/+0x68). Recovered plaintext length must \e\e 0x41 (65) .\n 2) Whirlpool: W(packetData[5..endOfEntries]) compared to plaintext[1..64] . plaintext[0] (magic byte) is NOT checked anywhere - any non-zero leading byte works (0x0a and 0x01 behave identically).\nOn success : archive_count(+0x10)\ecount, entries(+0x18)\ealloc. On ANY failure: returns with archive_count\e0, entries\eNULL (object still allocated). This count\e0 is what makes RequestGroupFromDisk trap at 0xb61ad0 for the first low-index request.
func=jag::Js5MasterIndex::Js5MasterIndex	func_addr=0x00b6c7f0	kind=eol	insn_offset_from_entry=798	cu_index_from_entry=154	text=RSA-decrypted plaintext length MUST \e\e 0x41 (65). If not -> fall through to cleanup, return with archive_count(+0x10) left 0 (master index REJECTED). Wrong RSA modulus patch -> garbage length (~modulus size) -> reject here.
func=jag::Js5MasterIndex::Js5MasterIndex	func_addr=0x00b6c7f0	kind=eol	insn_offset_from_entry=1194	cu_index_from_entry=230	text=Whirlpool over packetData[5 .. endOfEntries] \e archiveCount byte + entries table (count*0x50). RDI\edata+5, RSI\ebitLength\e(1+count*0x50)*8. Server must hash EXACTLY this range (excludes leading 5 bytes and trailing signature).
func=jag::Js5MasterIndex::Js5MasterIndex	func_addr=0x00b6c7f0	kind=eol	insn_offset_from_entry=1285	cu_index_from_entry=242	text=Compare computed whirlpool[0..63] (R11) to plaintext[1..64] (RDI+1..). plaintext[0] (RSA block magic byte) is NEVER read/compared - no magic-byte check. Mismatch -> 0xb5e980 -> reject (archive_count left 0).
func=jag::Js5MasterIndex::Js5MasterIndex	func_addr=0x00b6c7f0	kind=eol	insn_offset_from_entry=3793	cu_index_from_entry=789	text=ACCEPT: archive_count(+0x10)\ecount, entries(+0x18)\eallocated. Reached only after length\e\e65 AND whirlpool match. This is the ONLY writer of archive_count to non-zero.
func=jag::PacketHandlers::MapProjanimHalfsqAlt	func_addr=0x000f3080	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=MAP_PROJANIM_HALFSQ_ALT (S2C, top-op 163, zone sub-op idx 16, size 29). Half-square + capacity-widened projectile via ProjectileList::Add. Combines HALFSQ finer coords with V2 full packed 24-bit start/end fine offsets (local_50/local_44). srcCoordHalf X\e(b>>4)+baseTileX*2, Y\e(b&0xf)+baseTileY*2. bVar6&2 -> divide one field /4; bVar6&1 -> flag. Reads two g3 model/id triples, g2 spotanimId(0xffff gate), heights, alpha byte(0xff->-1), g2 angle(<<2), and two packed 24-bit offsets. Total 29. Full field roles need capture confirmation.
