func=jag::MainLogicManager::MouseInputRecorder::OnMouseWheel	func_addr=0x00caf670	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::MainLogicManager::MouseInputRecorder::OnMouseWheel -- eighth and last of the recorder's\nmouse delegates. Accumulates the wheel delta (passed in the fourth argument register) into\nrecorder->wheelAccum and pushes NOTHING into either ring, so wheel motion is invisible to both\nmouse prots. HYPOTHESIS on the name: identified by its slot position after the three\nbutton down/up pairs and the move delegate, and by taking a float delta; the wheel semantic is\ninferred, the "no ring push" fact is certain.
