func=jag::game::Conversion::WorldDeltaToRenderAngle	func_addr=0x00a8b300	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=Render yaw from a world-space horizontal delta \e atan2(-deltaXEast, -deltaZNorth) in radians (the atan2(dx,dz) result is shifted by +/-PI, which negates both args). Same radians space as the FACE_DIRECTION override at entity+0x23c (JagexAngleToRadians). Called by the entity orientation/turn update FUN_004a4050 with (targetX-selfX, targetZ-selfZ). Server inverse to face (dx,dy) tiles: angle16384 \e round(atan2(-dx,-dy)*16384/(2*PI)) & 0x3FFF.
