func=jag::PacketHandlers::MapProjanimAlt	func_addr=0x000f3400	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=MAP_PROJANIM_ALT (S2C, top-op 215, size 28). STANDALONE only in 949 (dropped from zone sub-op vector). Capacity-widened MAP_PROJANIM: source/dest positions carry FULL packed 24-bit fine offsets (local_50/local_44: (v&0x7ff)-0x3ff, (v>>11&0x7ff)-0x3ff, sign@>>0x16). Via ProjectileList::Add. 949 wire:\n+0  g1  srcCoord \e (localX&7)<<3 | (localY&7) | flag<<7\n+1  g1s destYdelta  +2 g1s destXdelta\n+3  g3(BE) id/medium ((b3<<16)|(b4<<8)|b5)\n+6  g2(BE) spotanimId (0xffff gate)  +8 g2(BE) startX'  +10 g2(BE) startY'  +12 g2(BE) short'\n+16 g1 alpha byte (0xff->-1)  +17 g2(BE) angle(<<2)\n+19 g3(BE) packed srcOffset (bytes 22..24)  +25 g3(BE) packed dstOffset (bytes 25..27). Total 28. Confirm exact roles via capture.
