func=jag::ClientProt::SendMoveGame	func_addr=0x0029a3a0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=ClientProt op58 builder (desc 0x015d3b10, size -2 VAR_SHORT). Emits a multi-waypoint PATH move: p2 count, 3x path segments (FUN_00aebda0), then run-flag byte (param_5|2 if param_6). Invoked from CS2 clientscript opcodes FUN_0026e4d0 / FUN_0026e680 (read script int/string stacks). OFFICIAL NAME \e UNKNOWN_58: NOT MOVE_GAMECLICK (that is op74, user-confirmed fixed 5B); distinct from MOVE_SCRIPTED\eop17 (fixed 5B CS2 single-coord). No matching enum in the older reference (all 4 ref move enums are fixed-size); op58 is a newer varShort path opcode with no reference name.
