func=jag::Packet::gT_unsigned_int	func_addr=0x00121450	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=jag::Packet::gT_unsigned_int — reads a big-endian uint32 from the packet buffer. Reads 4 bytes from packet buffer (this+0x10) at position (this+0x18), advances position by 4. If the platform endianness probe global \e\e 0x3020100 (little-endian host detected), byte-swaps the result via BSWAP/CMOVZ so the returned value is always interpreted as big-endian. Ported 948-2-2 (0x001218e0) -> 948-5 (0x00121a60): exact 11-instruction match, same constant 0x3020100; endianness probe global shifted 0x01050aa0 -> 0x01050dc0.
