func=jag::game::BASType::DecodeType	func_addr=0x00656550	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=BAS/RenderAnim (index 32) DecodeType. op1 reads TWO seqs: field1 (+0x38)\estandAnim, field2 (+0x94)\eFORWARD-WALK anim (NOT standTurn). Verified: human bas 1 op1\e(808 human_ready, 819 human_walk_f); live login BAS\e2697 op1\e(18022, 18044). SelectBaseAnimation reads +0x94(walk) for WALK/CRAWL MoveSpeed. op6\erun. Engine BASDecoder mislabels op1.field2 as standTurnAnim + op2/op3 as walk/run (op2/op3 are unused in real data).
