func=jag::PacketHandlers::MapAnimAlt	func_addr=0x00171f10	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=MAP_ANIM_ALT (S2C, top-op 183, zone sub-op idx 10, size 14). Capacity-widened MAP_ANIM. DISASM-verified byte offsets; dual-purpose: spotanimId\e\e0xffff \e> REMOVE existing tile spot-anim at coord (scene cull loop); else ADD via FUN_0016a060. 949 wire (raw/BE):\n+0  g1     packedCoord \e (localX&7)<<4 | (localY&7)   [X hi-nibble +baseTileX, Y lo-nibble +baseTileY]\n+1  g2(BE) spotanimId (0xffff \e REMOVE mode)\n+3  g2(BE) value2 (height/z or rotation short)\n+5  g2(BE) value3 (bit15 \e flag, low 15 bits \e data -> node+0x78)\n+7  g1     heightByte (scaled * DAT_00d66e28)\n+8..10     RESERVED (3 bytes, unread)\n+11 g3(BE) packed fine offset ((v&0x7ff)-0x3ff, (v>>11&0x7ff)-0x3ff, sign\e(v>>22)\e\e1)\nTotal 14. Exact value2/value3 roles need a live capture.
