func=jag::PacketHandlers::ClientSetvarcbitLarge	func_addr=0x001167a0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=OFFICIAL_PROT_NAME\eCLIENT_SETVARCBIT_LARGE direction\eSERVER opcode\e50 size\e6\n\nPayload: [0..3] g4_alt1 value (LE), [4..5] g2_add_LE varcbitId.\nBit variant: resolves the bit type through the dynamic lookup (state\e\e4 -> provider+0x230 -> +0x38,\nvftable+0x40) with the shared default bit-type object 0x01457030 -- the identical marker used by the\nconfirmed VarbitSmall. Writes into the CLIENT var domain at client+0x19450 (varcbit setter\n0x00ada260, which masks by the type's startBit/endBit at +0x48/+0x4c).\nPlayer-var counterpart VarbitLarge uses domain client+0x19b40.
