func=jag::packethandlers::Friends::UPDATE_FRIENDLIST	func_addr=0x001a3f50	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=949 op3 UPDATE_FRIENDLIST / FriendStatus (var_short) — CAPTURE-VERIFIED against 1057B/63-friend sample (supersedes stale "op26" numbering; op3 per prot_names_949-1.json + byte-exact decode). Layout unchanged from 948 (schema P). Per friend record (loop while pos<len): g1 warnMessage(0 normal,1 name-change); gStr displayName; gStr previousName; g2 worldId(0\eoffline); g1 fcRank; g1 flags(bit0\ereferredByYou, bit1\ereferredByThem); if worldId>0 {gStr worldName; g1 platform; g4 worldFlags}; gStr notes. Stores stride 0x78, sets RelMgr+0x10\e2. See docs/949-1/net/social/friends.md
